@startuml Incremental_Load_Process
!theme cerulean-outline
title AdventureWorks Sales BI Platform - Incremental (Delta) Load Process
caption Activity diagram for SSIS stored procedure-based incremental ETL pipeline

skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam roundCorner 10

skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    BorderColor #1565C0
    DiamondBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    DiamondBorderColor #F9A825
    StartColor #2E7D32
    EndColor #C62828
}

skinparam partition {
    BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
    BorderColor #9E9E9E
}

|#E8F5E9| **SSIS Orchestrator**
|#FFF3E0| **01_Load_Dimension.dtsx**
|#E3F2FD| **02_Load_FactSales.dtsx**
|#F3E5F5| **Logging & Monitoring**

|**SSIS Orchestrator**|
start

:Read **last load timestamp**\nfrom ETL control table;

note right
  The control table stores
  the last successful load
  datetime for each entity
end note

:Connect to **AdventureWorks2019**\n(OLTP source database);

:Identify changed records\nsince last load timestamp\n(ModifiedDate > LastLoadDate);

|**01_Load_Dimension.dtsx**|

partition "Dimension Loading (Parallel)" {

    fork
        :Execute **updateCurrency**\n---\nExtract: Sales.Currency\n+ Sales.CurrencyRate\nCompare: match on CurrencyCode\nSCD Type 1: overwrite changed\nInsert: new currency records;

        note right #FFF9C4
            **SCD Type 1 Logic**
            Check if record exists
            in DW by business key.
            If exists & changed:
              UPDATE (overwrite)
            If not exists:
              INSERT new record
        end note

    fork again
        :Execute **updateCustomer**\n---\nExtract: Sales.Customer\n+ Person.Person\n+ Person.Address\nCompare: match on CustomerID\nSCD Type 1: overwrite changed\nInsert: new customer records;

    fork again
        :Execute **UpdateProduct**\n---\nExtract: Production.Product\n+ Production.ProductSubcategory\n+ Production.ProductCategory\nCompare: match on ProductID\nSCD Type 1: overwrite changed\nInsert: new product records;

    fork again
        :Execute **updateSalesPerson**\n---\nExtract: Sales.SalesPerson\n+ HumanResources.Employee\n+ Person.Person\nCompare: match on SalesPersonID\nSCD Type 1: overwrite changed\nInsert: new salesperson records;

    fork again
        :Execute **updateShipMethod**\n---\nExtract: Purchasing.ShipMethod\nCompare: match on ShipMethodID\nSCD Type 1: overwrite changed\nInsert: new ship methods;

    fork again
        :Execute **updateTerritory**\n---\nExtract: Sales.SalesTerritory\nCompare: match on TerritoryID\nSCD Type 1: overwrite changed\nInsert: new territory records;

    end fork
}

|**SSIS Orchestrator**|

if (All dimensions\nloaded successfully?) then (yes)
    :Proceed to fact loading;
else (no)
    |**Logging & Monitoring**|
    :Log dimension load **FAILURE**\n---\nRecord: error message,\nfailed procedure,\ntimestamp, row counts;
    :Send alert notification;
    |**SSIS Orchestrator**|
    stop
endif

|**02_Load_FactSales.dtsx**|

partition "Fact Loading" {
    :Execute **updateSales**\n---\nExtract: Sales.SalesOrderHeader\n+ Sales.SalesOrderDetail\nwhere ModifiedDate > LastLoadDate;

    :Lookup dimension keys:\n- CustomerKey (from DW Customer)\n- ProductKey (from DW Products)\n- TerritoryKey (from DW Territory)\n- CurrencyKey (from DW Currency)\n- SalesPersonKey (from DW SalesPerson)\n- ShipMethodKey (from DW ShipMethod);

    :Transform & calculate:\n- LineTotal (UnitPrice * Qty * (1-Discount))\n- TotalProductCost\n- Freight (allocated per line)\n- TaxAmt (allocated per line);

    :Insert new fact records\ninto **AdventureWorksDW_Sales.Sales**;

    note right #E8F5E9
        Fact table is append-only
        for new sales orders.
        No updates to existing
        fact records (immutable).
    end note
}

|**SSIS Orchestrator**|

if (Fact load\nsuccessful?) then (yes)
    :Update **last load timestamp**\nin ETL control table\nto current datetime;
else (no)
    |**Logging & Monitoring**|
    :Log fact load **FAILURE**\n---\nRecord: error message,\nrows attempted vs loaded,\ntimestamp;
    :Send alert notification;
    |**SSIS Orchestrator**|
    stop
endif

|**Logging & Monitoring**|

:Log load **SUCCESS** statistics\n---\nDimension rows: inserted / updated\nFact rows: inserted\nDuration: start to end\nTimestamp: completion time;

:Update ETL audit trail\n---\nPackage: execution ID\nStatus: Success\nRow counts per entity;

|**SSIS Orchestrator**|

stop

legend right
  |= Phase |= Package |= Procedures |
  | Dimensions | 01_Load_Dimension.dtsx | updateCurrency, updateCustomer, |
  |  |  | UpdateProduct, updateSalesPerson, |
  |  |  | updateShipMethod, updateTerritory |
  | Facts | 02_Load_FactSales.dtsx | updateSales |
  |= SCD Type |= Strategy |= Behavior |
  | Type 1 | Overwrite | Update in place, no history |
endlegend

footer AdventureWorks Sales BI Platform | Incremental Load Process Diagram

@enduml
